      "role": "user",
      "content": "but local action feels like playing whack-a-mole with a forest fire lol. like, even if i recycle or whatever, the trajectory is still downward. it feels more like a delusion to stay positive than anything else. how am i supposed to care about \"building momentum\" when the science says we've already passed the point of no return? it just makes everything feel so hollow.",
